# Stands in for the real Quickshell that Omarchy installs into Qt's own qml
# directory. Naming a plugin Omaweb does not ship is what makes the decoy bite:
# if the shim's qmldir stops shadowing it, the engine resolves the module here
# and fails to load the plugin, exactly as it does on an Omarchy host.
module Quickshell
plugin quickshell-coreplugin
